<div class="advanced-controls" id="advancedControls" hidden><div><label for="protectedTerms">Keep these terms unchanged</label><input id="protectedTerms" placeholder="Names, product terms, phrases — separate with commas"><p>Existing quotations, citations, numbers and links are checked for changes.</p></div><div><label for="voiceSample">Your voice <span class="label-note">optional · no saved profile</span></label><textarea id="voiceSample" rows="2" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Add a short sample of your own writing to guide the tone."></textarea><p class="voice-retention-note">Voice references are sent only when requested. Queued data remains until processing finishes or expires; the default expiry is 24 hours, with cleanup following server retention settings.</p><button class="text-button" id="clearVoice">Clear voice sample</button></div></div>
<div class="editor-grid"><section class="editor-card source-card" aria-labelledby="sourceHeading"><header class="editor-header"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="panel-number">01</span><h2 id="sourceHeading">Your original</h2></div><div class="editor-tabs" aria-label="Original view"><button class="editor-tab active" data-source-tab="edit">Edit</button><button class="editor-tab" data-source-tab="evidence" id="evidenceTab">Evidence <span id="evidenceDot" hidden></span></button></div></header><div class="editor-body"><textarea id="inputText" class="writing-area" spellcheck="true" aria-label="Original writing" placeholder="A thought, a paragraph, a whole first draft.&#10;&#10;Paste your writing here and let's give it a little room to breathe."></textarea><div class="evidence-area" id="evidenceArea" hidden><p class="empty-evidence">Run detection to review sentence evidence here.</p></div><div class="source-empty-tools" id="sourceEmptyTools"><button id="sampleButton" class="sample-button">Try a sample <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button><span>or start with your own words</span></div></div><div class="selection-banner" id="selectionBanner" hidden><span id="selectionLabel"></span><button class="text-button" id="clearSelection">Use full draft ×</button></div><footer class="editor-footer"><span id="inputMeta">0 words <span>·</span> 0 characters</span><button class="text-button" id="importButton"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-upload"/></svg> Import document</button><input type="file" id="fileInput" accept=".txt,.docx,.pdf" hidden></footer></section>
