<section class="screen preferences-screen" id="screen-settings" hidden><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">MAKE YOURSELF AT HOME</div><h1>Your preferences.</h1><p>A considered workspace starts with clear choices.</p></div></div><div class="preferences-grid"><section class="settings-card"><h2>Processing & privacy</h2><p>Local style review uses writing statistics without external AI processing. AI detection and rewriting send the text you choose to configured external providers.</p><div id="connectionDetails"></div><label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" id="externalConsent"><span>I agree to send the selected draft, rewrite settings and any voice sample to the configured providers when I run an AI action.</span></label><p class="muted">This acknowledgement applies to this browser session. You can turn it off here.</p><button class="button button-secondary" id="clearLocalDraft">Clear this browser's draft</button></section><section class="settings-card"><h2>Available capabilities</h2><div id="capabilityList"><p class="muted">Checking configured services…</p></div><p class="muted">A feature is available only when its service is connected. No substitute AI scores are generated.</p></section><section class="settings-card"><h2>About your results</h2><p>Detector scores retain their provider's definition. A classification confidence is different from an estimate of AI involvement.</p><p>Edited drafts make earlier scans out of date. Before-and-after scores are compared only when the service reports that they are comparable.</p><p>A score is a review signal. Read the writing and the evidence before drawing conclusions.</p></section><section class="settings-card"><h2>Your account</h2><p>Save documents, review versions and control shared reports from your account.</p>@auth<button class="button button-secondary" id="settingsAccount">Manage account <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button>@else<a class="button button-primary" href="/register">Create your workspace <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>@endauth</section></div></section>
