<dialog id="shareDialog" class="modal"><form method="dialog" class="modal-close-form"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Close"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button></form><span class="eyebrow">A SECOND PAIR OF EYES</span><h2>Share a read-only report.</h2><p>Anyone with the link can see this report and its draft text. You can revoke access here at any time.</p><div class="share-link-row"><input id="shareUrl" aria-label="Read-only share link" readonly placeholder="Create a link to this saved draft"><button class="button button-secondary" id="copyShare">Copy</button></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="button button-danger" id="revokeShare">Revoke links</button><button class="button button-primary" id="createShare">Create share link <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></div></dialog>
<dialog id="accountDialog" class="modal modal-wide"><form method="dialog" class="modal-close-form"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Close account"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button></form><span class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE, YOUR CONTROL</span><h2>Your account.</h2><div id="accountContent"><p class="muted">Loading account…</p></div><div class="account-section"><h3>Plan & subscriptions</h3><div id="billingContent"><p class="muted">Checking subscription availability…</p></div></div><div class="account-section"><div class="section-row"><h3>API tokens</h3><button class="text-button" id="loadTokens">Refresh</button></div><p class="muted">Create a token for your own integrations. New tokens are shown once.</p><form id="tokenForm" class="token-form"><input id="tokenName" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Token name" aria-label="Token name"><button class="button button-secondary">Create token</button></form><div id="newToken" class="secret-token" hidden></div><div id="tokenList"></div></div><div class="account-section danger-section"><h3>Delete your account</h3><p>Delete your account and stored documents. This cannot be undone.</p><form id="deleteAccountForm"><input type="password" id="deletePassword" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="Confirm your password" aria-label="Password to confirm deletion"><label class="checkbox-row"><input id="confirmDeleteAccount" type="checkbox" required><span>I want to permanently delete my account and documents.</span></label><button class="button button-danger">Delete account & documents</button></form></div><form action="/logout" method="post" class="logout-form">@csrf<button class="text-button">Sign out ↗</button></form></dialog>
<dialog id="principlesDialog" class="modal"><form method="dialog" class="modal-close-form"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Close"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button></form><span class="eyebrow">A MORE CONSIDERED WAY TO WRITE</span><h2>Clarity, with context.</h2><ol class="principles-list"><li><strong>Start with your words.</strong> Paste a draft or preview a document import.</li><li><strong>Choose your next step.</strong> Detect signals, revise writing, or do both in one flow.</li><li><strong>Keep the evidence.</strong> Review actual provider results, protected text and the changes.</li><li><strong>Make it yours.</strong> Accept, edit, save or export. You have the final say.</li></ol><p class="muted">Local style signals are separate from AI detection. No detector can prove authorship from text alone.</p></dialog>
<dialog id="importChoiceDialog" class="modal"><form method="dialog" class="modal-close-form"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Close import options"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button></form><span class="eyebrow">BRING YOUR WORDS WITH YOU</span><h2>Start with a document.</h2><p>Choose a file or fetch text from a public page. You'll preview the extracted text before adding it to the studio.</p><div class="import-choices"><button class="button button-secondary" id="chooseFileButton"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-upload"/></svg> Choose TXT, DOCX or supported PDF</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="importUrlButton" disabled>Import a public URL <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></div><p class="muted" id="urlImportAvailability">Checking URL import availability…</p></dialog>
<dialog id="urlImportDialog" class="modal"><form method="dialog" class="modal-close-form"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="Close URL import"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button></form><span class="eyebrow">A DRAFT FROM THE WEB</span><h2>Import a public page.</h2><p>The server fetches this page to extract text. This step does not contact an AI provider or run website scripts.</p><form id="urlImportForm" class="url-import-form"><label for="importUrl">Public page address</label><input id="importUrl" type="url" required maxlength="4096" placeholder="https://example.com/article" autocomplete="url"><p id="urlHostPreview" class="muted">Enter a public HTTP or HTTPS address. Sign-in pages are not supported.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="button button-primary" id="fetchUrlButton">Fetch text preview <span>↗</span></button></div></form><div id="urlImportError" class="notice error" hidden></div></dialog>
<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" hidden><span id="toastText"></span><button id="dismissToast" aria-label="Dismiss notification">×</button></div>
</body></html>
